(Financial Summary) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Revenue by segment, fiscal year 2025:) Tj T*
(Warehouse Automation: $248.3 million) Tj T*
(Surgical Robotics: $121.9 million) Tj T*
(Agricultural Robotics: $42.4 million) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Revenue by segment, fiscal year 2024:) Tj T*
(Warehouse Automation: $221.7 million) Tj T*
(Surgical Robotics: $83.6 million) Tj T*
(Agricultural Robotics: $32.9 million) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Gross margin was 46.8% in 2025, compared with 44.1% in 2024, driven by lower component costs) Tj T*
(for Atlas robots and a higher share of software revenue.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Operating income was $37.5 million in 2025, compared with $21.9 million in 2024.) Tj T*
(Net income was $28.1 million in 2025, compared with $14.6 million in 2024.) Tj T*
(Research and development expense was $71.2 million in 2025, compared with $58.9 million in) Tj T*
(2024.) Tj T*
(Sales, general and administrative expense was $84.4 million in 2025.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(At December 31, 2025, Northwind held $186.4 million in cash and cash equivalents and had no) Tj T*
(outstanding bank debt. Free cash flow for the year was $31.7 million.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
