(Quarterly Results) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Revenue by quarter, fiscal year 2025:) Tj T*
(First quarter: $88.4 million) Tj T*
(Second quarter: $97.1 million) Tj T*
(Third quarter: $106.3 million) Tj T*
(Fourth quarter: $120.8 million) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The first quarter was affected by the motion-controller shortage described in the letter) Tj T*
(from the Chief Executive Officer. Revenue grew in every subsequent quarter as Atlas) Tj T*
(deliveries recovered and Helix sales began in the United States.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Fourth-quarter revenue was the highest in company history. Orders received in the fourth) Tj T*
(quarter included the largest single Atlas order to date: 420 robots for a European grocery) Tj T*
(distributor.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Order backlog at December 31, 2025 was $214.0 million, compared with $167.5 million a year) Tj T*
(earlier. Approximately 70% of the backlog is expected to be delivered in 2026.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
