(Research and Development) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Our research and development organisation employs 540 engineers and scientists across) Tj T*
(Pittsburgh, Toronto and Munich.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(In March 2025 the Helix platform received FDA 510\(k\) clearance for knee replacement) Tj T*
(procedures, which allowed commercial sales in the United States to begin in the second) Tj T*
(quarter. A submission for hip replacement procedures is planned for 2026.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The third generation of the Atlas robot, Atlas v3, launched in September 2025. Atlas v3) Tj T*
(offers a battery life of 14 hours on a single charge and can carry payloads of up to 600) Tj T*
(kilograms. The previous model, Atlas v2, offered 9 hours of battery life and a 450 kilogram) Tj T*
(payload.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Furrow received a software update that improved weed detection accuracy to 97% in field) Tj T*
(trials, up from 91% for the previous version.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Northwind has been granted 128 patents worldwide, including 19 patents granted during 2025.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
