(Customers and Markets) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(North America generated 58% of 2025 revenue, Europe 31% and Asia-Pacific 11%.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(In warehouse automation, customers include third-party logistics providers, grocery) Tj T*
(distributors and e-commerce retailers. The installed base of Atlas robots reached 9,600) Tj T*
(units at the end of 2025.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(In surgical robotics, 74 hospitals were using Helix at the end of 2025, of which 41 were in) Tj T*
(the United States and 33 in Europe. Each Helix system performed an average of 210 procedures) Tj T*
(during the year.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(In agricultural robotics, Furrow robots operated on more than 5,000 hectares of farmland,) Tj T*
(mainly in California, the Netherlands and Spain. Agricultural customers typically buy robots) Tj T*
(before the spring planting season, so segment revenue is concentrated in the first half of) Tj T*
(the year.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
