(Sustainability and People) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(In 2025, 62% of the electricity used at Northwind facilities came from renewable sources, up) Tj T*
(from 48% in 2024.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Scope 1 and scope 2 greenhouse gas emissions were 18,400 tonnes of CO2 equivalent, a) Tj T*
(reduction of 12% compared with 2024.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Voluntary employee turnover was 9.3% in 2025. Women made up 31% of our engineering staff.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Every employee receives 40 hours of paid training per year, and we launched an) Tj T*
(apprenticeship programme with Pittsburgh community colleges that enrolled 64 apprentices.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Product safety is a core value. Atlas robots completed more than 41 million kilometres of) Tj T*
(autonomous travel in 2025 with no injuries to people reported by customers.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
