(Corporate Governance) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The Board of Directors has nine members, seven of whom are independent. The Chair of the) Tj T*
(Board is Thomas Okafor, who has served as an independent director since 2019.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The Board has three standing committees: Audit, Compensation, and Nominating and Governance.) Tj T*
(The Audit Committee met eight times in 2025.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The independent auditor of Northwind is Hartley and Reed LLP, which has audited the company) Tj T*
(since 2017.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Executive compensation is linked to revenue growth, operating margin and product safety) Tj T*
(targets. In 2025, 60% of the Chief Executive Officer's target compensation was performance-) Tj T*
(based.) Tj T*
ET
