(Outlook for 2026) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(For fiscal year 2026, Northwind expects total revenue between $480 million and $500 million,) Tj T*
(and an operating margin of approximately 10%.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(We plan to open a new assembly plant in Monterrey, Mexico in the third quarter of 2026 to) Tj T*
(serve customers in the Americas and to reduce tariff exposure.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Planned capital expenditure for 2026 is $55 million, mainly for the Monterrey plant and for) Tj T*
(expanding Helix production capacity.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(We will continue to prioritise reinvestment in research and development and in international) Tj T*
(expansion.) Tj T*
ET
